        "TileImage": "$($repository a7955c8b-ae26-4418-b788-c25b89e23f5b).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Today&apos;s targets are twins in Bangkok, at the Himmapa Hotel. The twins&apos; names are Hannah Devaux and Scarlett Gardiner, they have both sent us to assassinate each other without knowing that one of them has had the same idea. I don&apos;t know much about their back story, but there&apos;s always use for free money. This mission is extremely difficult, and the sisters specifically asked us to make the murder look like murder. You could have use for a bomb. Good luck agent. Have fun!",
